Except as granted to an Authorized Recipient in Section 4, or by separate written permission from the Licensor, you may not:

a. Distribute the Licensed Materials, whether modified or not. The fact that the Licensor has published them publicly grants no right to republish them;

b. make a Public Deployment of the Licensed Materials or of any version of them;

c. modify the Licensed Materials for any purpose other than Non-Production Use;

d. engage in Template Use;

e. sell, rent, lease, sublicense, or otherwise commercially exploit the Licensed Materials, or offer them as part of a paid or hosted product or service, including website-development, template, theme, hosting, or software-as-a-service offerings;

f. use the Licensed Materials, in whole or in part, to train, fine-tune, or evaluate a machine-learning or artificial-intelligence model, to build a dataset for such use, or for any other text and data mining. The Licensor expressly reserves these rights, including for the purposes of Article 4(3) of Directive (EU) 2019/790. This restriction does not prevent the use of software tools to read or analyze the Licensed Materials for a purpose this License permits;

